; M10 rescue card (format it in the camera, FAT32): H:/backup.ttl next to the stock rg2_v003.frm.
; BAK runs this for every boot cause before its own dispatch (finding 22 2.1):
; combo (dial MOVIE + shutter fully pressed + POWER), APP header failure, crash.
; Reflashes stock APP + RES; `up` checks header and nUpdateCsum before erasing.
; On success `up` powers off with a 3 s RTC wake and never returns (finding 27):
; the camera switches itself back on into the reflashed firmware.
; Markers: RESCUE_RAN = this script started; RESCUE_UP_RET = `up` refused or failed.
; Never leave this card in the camera for normal use. ASCII, CRLF.

foldercreate 'H:/RESCUE_RAN'
sprintf "up"
sendln inputstr
; reached only if up refused or failed: mark it, then switch off instead of idling in BAK
foldercreate 'H:/RESCUE_UP_RET'
sprintf "forcedown"
sendln inputstr
end
